==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{term|lang=eo|ki-||interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix}} + {{term|lang=eo|-a||correlative suffix of kind}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Eo-kia.ogg|Audio|lang=eo}}

===Determiner===
{{eo-det}}

# what kind of, which kind of (the interrogative and relative correlative of kind)

====Derived terms====
* {{l|eo|kia ajn|gloss=whatever kind of}}

===Usage notes===
Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kia''' can be combined with ''[[ajn]]'', the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kia''' ajn'' thus means ''whatever kind of''.

